  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Пакет ресурсов для мода Tooltip Overhaul, добавляющий несколько свежих<br>новых рамок для создателей модпаков!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Если вы не знаете, как применить эти рамки к своим предметам, просто посетите <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki Tooltip Overhaul</a><br></strong>примечание: путь к файлам текстур рамок совпадает с путём к текстурам рамок Tooltip Overhaul</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Добавленные рамки:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">allay_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9998241b-53f8-486d-b279-c970bf2950e5.gif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ef832afe-945f-4f2e-ba62-ef4cae154c0d.png\" width=\"269\" height=\"134\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">archery_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d23f2f37-5881-430d-a69b-82a8e45a7c87.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9fd5e617-45fa-48f1-9046-799e87f6d5e7.png\" width=\"294\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">bee_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1853f899-a264-4eea-89c7-eb5e28326237.gif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_48b59a0a-a6c1-4bdb-98d5-0f35ef92f052.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">chest_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_04271a88-10ea-4461-86d0-172d7a691660.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e8756e46-3c72-4e8f-9388-9c4623f6ff2b.png\" width=\"222\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">chicken_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e7458315-46ec-4c9a-9429-167752709873.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dba6fb46-d7b8-4a30-ad15-6d2e8b58cf78.png\" width=\"189\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">cobweb_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f281071b-2a43-430b-aceb-1a67b0e74982.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ecf20e9d-6b24-47f6-9cbc-0ea479966a9c.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">scale_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_30c97e90-1e3e-4872-ad65-be6fd69bd7a9.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fd01f4b7-9934-41f3-9645-767f50542cfb.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">red_scale_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6443a1e6-a4c9-43ea-87b1-aa4abf8f14f6.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_536878d3-7bcc-47e6-b984-2cec026bba3b.png\" width=\"251\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">orange_scale_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f7b564cb-90af-4662-b045-e3b773dd9cdb.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0a27e5ce-5a91-4c7f-9e5f-fd849304ba4a.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">draconic_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_75c96f34-ff3a-48c2-8d64-5019551e392c.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5fc29a56-a3e0-48ca-8f75-073fc44d2ab8.png\" width=\"477\" height=\"185\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">red_draconic_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8e1e0ece-604e-4d8c-8195-8956654be791.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e76c0640-aebd-4cc8-9201-0e482740a098.png\" width=\"478\" height=\"192\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">orange_draconic_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d5b775f-851d-4e2e-99ad-29ff3a05860b.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ff9d3a83-6d6a-4a54-a4c6-39c23d13fa64.png\" width=\"477\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">fish_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e7e8b9eb-3227-473d-9716-725035f1d1bb.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_541d9805-83af-49c6-8141-87de9f4ecba3.png\" width=\"316\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">hullback_frame (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/whaleborne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">совместимость с Whaleborne</a>!)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6061bb38-ed30-41f8-af65-5ea9979f12de.gif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1537391b-8ae2-4cfc-b7a8-7f67f0d09006.png\" width=\"274\" height=\"163\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">knight_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_28bb8943-603b-404c-914d-3ed5f62f464b.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45fe739e-1e80-4fb0-86c1-76d10d4052b9.png\" width=\"357\" height=\"182\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">golden_knight_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f125751a-3b8d-4e1f-ae78-b3f81627283f.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9149c450-2b3c-410f-bafb-8eb88e76b950.png\" width=\"364\" height=\"167\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">diamond_knight_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3346acb0-c3ae-43b1-a65c-288c086e19bf.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_62d3e699-a38e-4950-92fc-223dbc69e0d5.png\" width=\"361\" height=\"185\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">meal_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_77076ef8-78cd-47d7-a197-1710db013e6a.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a2343edd-4b7f-4500-b71d-cb362375feb2.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"166\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">uranium_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cccc0016-5ed8-4ddf-8b01-2f3fdfccd1eb.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_02520387-1d6f-4bbb-ac92-8135d0522db7.png\" width=\"336\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">radioactive_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9efc409f-376d-459f-a9ff-7531eb83994c.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3ddbee49-122c-461a-9359-bc1388200581.png\" width=\"339\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">spectre_frame (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/species\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">совместимость с Species</a>!)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bc3b670a-f127-4f60-9391-34809d498da3.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b34f55b8-85fe-49b5-a6e2-36bfb272bc26.png\" width=\"395\" height=\"248\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">stick_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_14763763-b09b-4498-9030-511f862a4f18.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_399ab136-1f8a-49ff-a939-8de1fcc0d05d.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">scorching_frame</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5ec765f7-33aa-4911-a99f-64492077fa26.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d0605f28-9717-4552-a725-ecfe507f8510.png\" width=\"349\" height=\"130\"></p>",
